\subsection{\code{graph_components$as_metric_graph()}}{
  Combine all components into a single (disconnected)
\code{metric_graph} object via fast in-memory stacking.
Edges keep their relative order within each component, and the
\code{.edge_number} of every observation is shifted by the cumulative
edge count of preceding components. The resulting graph carries
a \code{disconnected = TRUE} flag (queryable via
