\code{add_observations()} on the returned graph is disallowed because
the user-facing edge numbering is no longer the per-component
one — add observations to the original \code{graph_components} and
call \code{as_metric_graph()} again.

Call this method explicitly before passing to repeated
downstream operations (e.g., \code{graph_lme}, \code{graph_spde},
\code{sample_spde}) to amortise the assembly cost across calls.
